WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.000
Life changes and Domoee is 
designed with that in mind.

2
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.040
If you want to move 
to another Domoee home,

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.720
you can transfer the value you've
already built instead of starting again.

4
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.920
And if you decide that Domoee 
isn't right for you anymore,

5
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.560
you'll also have the option 
to cash out and take the value

6
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.920
you've built with you.